OL,6,FA doctor who saved the life of a former
OL,7,FPremier League footballer who collapsed
OL,8,Fduring a televised match has been      
OL,9,Fstruck off the medical register for    
OL,10,Fhaving a sexual relationship with a    
OL,11,Fvulnerable patient.                    
OL,13,FJonathan Tobin was ruled unfit to      
OL,14,Fpractise by the Medical Practitioners  
OL,15,FTribunal Service (MPTS).               
